{
  "info": {
    "name": "FinTrack - 01 Acceso y perfil",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "FinTrack API v1. Selecciona el entorno Local o Render; baseUrl incluye /api/v1. Completa las credenciales en valores locales del entorno. Inicia sesión en Acceso y perfil para capturar accessToken. Los IDs se guardan al crear recursos. Esta plantilla portable procede de users.v1.json. Las modificaciones en Postman no se sincronizan automáticamente con Git."
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 Acceso",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Iniciar sesión",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const required = [\"email\",\"password\"];",
                  "const missing = required.filter(key => {const value = pm.variables.get(key); return typeof value !== 'string' || value.trim() === '' || value.includes('{{');});",
                  "if (missing.length) {console.error('Completa las variables locales del entorno: ' + missing.join(', ')); pm.execution.skipRequest();}",
                  "else {pm.environment.unset('accessToken'); pm.environment.unset('tokenExpiresAt');}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Estado HTTP 200', function () {pm.response.to.have.status(200);});",
                  "pm.test('JSON válido', function () {pm.response.json();});",
                  "pm.test('Respuesta privada sin caché', function () {pm.response.to.have.header('Cache-Control', 'no-store');});",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {const body = pm.response.json(); pm.test('Token de sesión emitido', function () {pm.expect(body.accessToken).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;}); if (body.accessToken) {pm.environment.set('accessToken', body.accessToken); pm.environment.set('tokenExpiresAt', body.expiresAt);}}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "protocolProfileBehavior": {
            "disableBodyPruning": true
          },
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "\n\nPOST /auth/login. Completa las variables requeridas en el entorno seleccionado: email, password. Ejemplo preparado desde el contrato; no se ejecutó esta operación en Render durante la creación."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Registrar cuenta nueva",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const required = [\"email\",\"password\",\"displayName\"];",
                  "const missing = required.filter(key => {const value = pm.variables.get(key); return typeof value !== 'string' || value.trim() === '' || value.includes('{{');});",
                  "if (missing.length) {console.error('Completa las variables locales del entorno: ' + missing.join(', ')); pm.execution.skipRequest();}",
                  "else {pm.environment.unset('accessToken'); pm.environment.unset('tokenExpiresAt');}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Estado HTTP 201', function () {pm.response.to.have.status(201);});",
                  "pm.test('JSON válido', function () {pm.response.json();});",
                  "pm.test('Respuesta privada sin caché', function () {pm.response.to.have.header('Cache-Control', 'no-store');});",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {const body = pm.response.json(); pm.test('Token de sesión emitido', function () {pm.expect(body.accessToken).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;}); if (body.accessToken) {pm.environment.set('accessToken', body.accessToken); pm.environment.set('tokenExpiresAt', body.expiresAt);}}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "protocolProfileBehavior": {
            "disableBodyPruning": true
          },
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"displayName\": \"{{displayName}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "\n\nPOST /auth/register. Completa las variables requeridas en el entorno seleccionado: email, password, displayName. Ejemplo preparado desde el contrato; no se ejecutó esta operación en Render durante la creación."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
